#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:218
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieHoldItRightThere"
msgid "ARCHIE: Hold it right there.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:221
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieSoItWasYou"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: Fufufu…\n"
"So it was you, after all.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:225
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieBeholdKyogre"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: Behold!\p"
"See how beautiful it is, the sleeping\n"
"form of the ancient POKéMON KYOGRE!\p"
"I have waited so long for this day to\n"
"come…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:232
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieYouMustDisappear"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: It surprises me, how you've\n"
"managed to chase me here.\p"
"But that's all over now.\p"
"For the realization of my dream,\n"
"you must disappear now!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:239
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieDefeat"
msgid ""
"What?!\n"
"I lost to a mere child like you?!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:243
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieWithThisRedOrb"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: Fufufu…\p"
"I commend you. I must recognize that\n"
"you are truly gifted.\p"
"But!\n"
"I have this in my possession!\p"
"With this RED ORB, I can make KYOGRE…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:251
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_RedOrbShinesByItself"
msgid ""
"The RED ORB suddenly began shining\n"
"by itself!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:255
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieWhereDidKyogreGo"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: What?!\p"
"I didn't do anything.\n"
"Why did the RED ORB…\p"
"Where did KYOGRE go?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:261
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieAMessageFromOutside"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: Hm? It's a message from our\n"
"members outside…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:265
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieWhatRainingTooHard"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: Yes, what is it?\p"
"Hm…\n"
"It's raining heavily?\p"
"Good… That should have happened.\n"
"That is why we awakened KYOGRE,\l"
"to realize TEAM AQUA's vision of\l"
"expanding the sea.\p"
"What?!\p"
"It's raining far harder than we\n"
"envisioned? You're in danger?\p"
"That can't be…\n"
"That's just not possible…\p"
"Hold your position and monitor\n"
"the situation!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:281
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieWhyDidKyogreDisappear"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: There's something wrong…\p"
"The RED ORB is supposed to awaken\n"
"and control KYOGRE…\p"
"But… Why?\n"
"Why did KYOGRE disappear?\p"
"Why?!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:289
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_MaxieWhatHaveYouWrought"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: What have you wrought?\p"
"ARCHIE… You've finally awoken KYOGRE,\n"
"haven't you?\p"
"What will happen to the world if this\n"
"downpour continues for all eternity?\p"
"The world's landmass will drown in\n"
"the deepening sea…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:298
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_ArchieDontGetAllHighAndMighty"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: W-what?!\n"
"Don't get all high and mighty with me!\p"
"Wasn't it you, TEAM MAGMA, that\n"
"infuriated GROUDON?\p"
"So long as I have this RED ORB,\n"
"I should be able to control KYOGRE…\p"
"I should be able to control it…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:307
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_MaxieWeDontHaveTimeToArgue"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: We don't have the time to\n"
"argue about it here!\p"
"Get outside and see for yourself!\p"
"See if what you've wrought is the\n"
"world that we desired!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room9/scripts.inc:314
msgctxt "SeafloorCavern_Room9_Text_MaxieComeOnPlayer"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: {PLAYER}, come on, you have\n"
"to get out of here, too!$"
msgstr ""
